flowchart LR
  A[T+0 alert fires: p95 or 5xx] --> B[T+5 acknowledge, name incident commander]
  B --> C[T+10 assess severity, open channel]
  C --> D[T+15 mitigate first: rollback, flag off, scale, fail over]
  D --> E[T+45 confirm recovery on SLIs]
  E --> F[T+60 status update, close incident]
  F --> G[T+3 days blameless postmortem]
  G --> H[T+14 days action items reviewed]
